1
00:00:00,685 --> 00:00:03,285
(Sheldon:)She gave it to my sister
about her boyfriend,

2
00:00:03,288 --> 00:00:05,188
(Sheldon:)my brother about his girlfriend,

3
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:07,360
(Sheldon:)my father about his girlfriend.

4
00:00:08,359 --> 00:00:12,099
(Sheldon:)That one had some
un-Christian words in it.

5
00:00:12,097 --> 00:00:14,527
(Amy:)Well, she likes me.

6
00:00:14,532 --> 00:00:17,032
(Amy:)You know, there's a chance
she might be okay with it.

7
00:00:17,035 --> 00:00:19,065
(Sheldon:)Eh, I don't know.

8
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:21,170
(Sheldon:)I am her precious little boy.

9
00:00:21,172 --> 00:00:24,872
And you did take my flower.

10
00:00:26,845 --> 00:00:29,745
(Penny:)Do boys have flowers?

11
00:00:31,807 --> 00:00:33,617
(Leonard:)Who knows what he has
down there.

12
00:00:33,641 --> 00:00:34,751
(Sheldon:)Mm.

13
00:00:34,753 --> 00:00:36,253
(Sheldon:)Anyway...

14
00:00:36,254 --> 00:00:38,784
(Mary:)Thank you, God, for the food
we are about to receive

15
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,860
(Mary:)and for the nourishment
of our bodies

16
00:00:40,859 --> 00:00:42,889
(Mary:)and bless the hands
that prepared it.

17
00:00:42,894 --> 00:00:44,924
(Mary:)Amen.

18
00:00:44,929 --> 00:00:47,529
(Sheldon:)Given that your
hands prepared it,

19
00:00:47,532 --> 00:00:49,762
(Sheldon:)isn't that a little
self-serving?

20
00:00:49,768 --> 00:00:52,398
(Mary:)You start changing
the words to the prayers,

21
00:00:52,403 --> 00:00:56,573
(Mary:)next thing you know, you're
in a church with a guitar.

22
00:00:57,542 --> 00:01:00,912
(Amy:)Thank you for cooking,
it looks delicious.

